    "enUS": {
      "description": "I take it you want those papers signed, lad?  ",
      "dialogue": {
        "127417291addc09d632c": "I take it you want those papers signed, $Glad:lass;?",
        "6bbec7f4fd76fc6dac52": "Aye, I suppose that little skirmish will pass as field duty nowadays. Take these back to Cenarion Hold, I'm sure they'll have a cushy job ready for you.$B$BOff you go!",
        "a166af036b46852531c7": "I take it you want those papers signed, $Glad:lass;?"
